Apple is continuing to refine <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/ios-27/">iOS 27</a> ahead of its planned September launch, and the third beta includes several new features. <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> is more customizable, there's a fun new wallpaper action, and some useful improvements to <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/photos/">Photos</a> and Shortcuts.<br/>
<br/>
