<h2>AirPods</h2><br/>
The Adaptive setting on the AirPods has a slider that lets you select more transparency or more noise cancellation.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/07/ios-27-airpods-adaptive.jpg" alt="" width="2000" height="1125" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1055345" /><br/>
<h2>Home App</h2><br/>
Apple clarified that <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-intelligence/">Apple Intelligence</a> features in the Home app <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/07/06/ios-27-home-app-features-icloud/">will require a 2TB iCloud+ plan</a>.<br/>
<br/>
<h2>Maps</h2><br/>
Apple added a tooltip to make it clearer that route preferences haven't been eliminated and can be accessed by tapping under the options interface when getting directions.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/07/ios-27-maps-routes.jpg" alt="" width="2000" height="1125" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1055340" /><br/>
<h2>Lock Screen</h2><br/>
The Control Center buttons on the Lock Screen now have black icons instead of white icons with some wallpaper. <br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/07/ios-27-lock-screen-icons.jpg" alt="" width="2000" height="1125" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1055346" /><br/>
